  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/124">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/124/1"/>A Song of Ascents of David.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/124/23"/>Had it not been for Adonoy
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/124/24"/>Who was for us,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/124/3"/>let Israel now say.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/124/4"/>Had it not been for Adonoy
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/124/5"/>Who was for us,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/124/6"/>when men rose up against us.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/124/7"/>They would have then swallowed us alive,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/124/8"/>when their wrath blazed against us.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/124/9"/>The waters would have then swept us away,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/124/10"/>affliction would have passed over our soul.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/124/11"/>Then over our soul would have gone
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/124/12"/>the impetuous waters.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/124/13"/>Blessed is Adonoy,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/124/14"/>Who did not give us
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/124/15"/>as prey to their teeth.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/124/16"/>Our soul escaped as a bird
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/124/25"/>out of the fowler's snare;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/124/26"/>the snare is broken
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/124/27"/>and we escaped.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/124/19"/>Our help is in the Name of Adonoy,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/124/20"/>Maker of heaven and earth.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
